=2 Walkthrough
* You must wait one game day after completing {q:Gifts of the Griffon|Gifts of the Griffon|Gifts of the Griffon} in order to start this quest.
* Talk to {n:Rholont} @ E-7 to trigger a cutscene. Leave the area, return, and then talk to Rholont again for more dialogue.
* Travel to {z:Jugner Forest (S)} from {z:East Ronfaure (S)}. Upon entering, a cutscene will play. Zoning into Jugner Forest (S) by any other routes will not trigger a cut scene.

:* {p:Survival Guide} to {z:East Ronfaure (S)} is the most direct route.

* Head to I-6 and touch the ??? (on a tree stump) to trigger a cutscene. After the cutscene is done, touching the ??? again will spawn an {m:Orc} {p:WAR} {p:NM|Notorious Monsters}, {m:Fingerfilcher Dradzad}
** Fingerfilcher Dradzad is immune to sleep.
* After defeating the NM check the ??? again for a cutscene to complete the quest and obtain your reward.

=2 Notes
* If continuing with Wings of the Goddess Missions, be sure to visit any of the {p:Cavernous maws} outside {p:Jeuno} **in the past** (or ones in the present that you have previously exited/activated from the past) to activate the mission {p:Cait Sith|Cait Sith (Mission)} after completing this quest.

=2 Lore
[**Minor spoilers for this mission**
* Young Excenmille's behavior changes after Zogbog calls him "Excenmille M Aurchiat". This is because he unintentionally called the boy a Monarlais: the middle initial in Elvaan names refers to their rank or title. Excenmille wouldn't be a Monarlais while his father, Count Alphonimile, is still lord of the territory of {p:Norvallen}.
** Refer to {p:Naming Customs (Lore)} to see other Elvaan titles.

